[{"text": "The assembly will now hear an address by", "start": 1.439, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "His Excellency", "start": 4.48, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Daniel Francisco Chapo, President of the", "start": 6.24, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "Republic of Mosmbique.", "start": 10.24, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 13.599, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 15.92, "duration": 6.199}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 19.119, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Your Excellency, heads of states and the", "start": 37.12, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "government.", "start": 39.76, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "Your Excellency", "start": 41.44, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "Khalil Raman,", "start": 43.44, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "President of the 81st session of the", "start": 45.92, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "United Nation General Assembly.", "start": 50.239, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "Your Excellency Antonio Gautes,", "start": 53.28, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Secretary General of the United Nations.", "start": 56.32, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Your Excellencies,", "start": 59.44, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "dear ministers here, president present", "start": 62.16, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "representing the heads of states. Allow", "start": 64.799, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "me to start by congratulating you, Mr.", "start": 67.76, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "President, on your election to preside", "start": 72.479, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "over the work of this assembly and", "start": 75.28, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "assure you the full support of the", "start": 77.759, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "Republic of Mosmbique. We also recognize", "start": 80.0, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "the work carried out by your", "start": 83.6, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "predecessor, her excellency Analena", "start": 86.64, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Barbok", "start": 90.0, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "in the service of this organization", "start": 92.0, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "whose contribution we greatly value. Mr.", "start": 94.56, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "President.", "start": 99.2, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "The topic chosen for this session,", "start": 100.72, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "restoring trust, managing", "start": 103.68, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "transformation,", "start": 106.24, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "a united nation that benefits all,", "start": 107.84, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "invites us to return to the opening", "start": 112.88, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "words of the United Nations charter,", "start": 115.68, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "simple words, yet perhaps amongst the", "start": 119.119, "duration": 6.921}, {"text": "most", "start": 123.04, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "powerful ever inscribed in an", "start": 127.2, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "international treaty.", "start": 129.28, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "We the people together has the most", "start": 131.44, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "comprehensive expression of our", "start": 135.92, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "collective responsibility towards the", "start": 138.64, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "humanity.", "start": 142.0, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "81 years ago in one in the face of", "start": 144.64, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "devastation caused by war, the humanity", "start": 148.56, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "chose cooperation over confrontation,", "start": 151.599, "duration": 11.761}, {"text": "the law of force and hope of fear.", "start": 156.4, "duration": 12.16}, {"text": "That promise has shaped generations.", "start": 163.36, "duration": 9.2}, {"text": "It has protected millions of lives in", "start": 168.56, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "the whole world and it gave voice to", "start": 172.56, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "those that during many time remained on", "start": 175.92, "duration": 8.959}, {"text": "the margin of international decisions.", "start": 180.16, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Today,", "start": 184.879, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "however, the promise that we face is one", "start": 186.8, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "of the toughest tests", "start": 189.76, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "as we live in a world marked by", "start": 192.48, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "protected wars, growing geopolitical", "start": 196.0, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "rivalities,", "start": 199.04, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "persistent humanitarian crisis, severe", "start": 200.64, "duration": 8.319}, {"text": "weather events, and other highly complex", "start": 204.159, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "challenges at the world.", "start": 208.959, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "At the same time, your excellency, the", "start": 212.08, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "digital revolution, the demographic", "start": 214.72, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "changes and the organization of the", "start": 218.0, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "value chains are transforming our", "start": 220.959, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "economies every day in the society at an", "start": 223.28, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "unprecedented pace.", "start": 227.599, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "Never has the world been so", "start": 230.959, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "interconnected and at the same time so", "start": 233.28, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "fragmented like today. And it's", "start": 236.4, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "precisely in this contest that the theme", "start": 239.92, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "of this session takes an important", "start": 243.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "significance.", "start": 246.239, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "Restoring trust requires consistency", "start": 247.76, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "between the principle we proclaim as", "start": 251.12, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "leaders and the decisions we make.", "start": 254.239, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "It requires the fair application of", "start": 259.04, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "international law and concrete results", "start": 262.079, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "that translate into improvement in the", "start": 265.6, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "lives of the people in the whole world.", "start": 269.36, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "In short, restoring trust means renewing", "start": 272.56, "duration": 11.6}, {"text": "the promise made 81 years ago. I repeat,", "start": 277.28, "duration": 12.56}, {"text": "we the people, Mr. President Mozambique", "start": 284.16, "duration": 9.2}, {"text": "knows from its own experience the value", "start": 289.84, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "of multilateralism", "start": 293.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "and the value of the United Nations.", "start": 295.44, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "This organization, this organization has", "start": 298.88, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "stood by our people at decisive moments", "start": 302.0, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "of its history on the path to our", "start": 305.84, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "national independence as a people in the", "start": 309.84, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "pursuit and building of peace in", "start": 313.12, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Mosmbique and in the national", "start": 315.84, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "reconstruction in the responding to", "start": 318.08, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "natural disasters and in the promotion", "start": 320.72, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "of sustainable development.", "start": 323.759, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "today in the process of the national", "start": 326.479, "duration": 9.081}, {"text": "dialogue. Thank you so much. UN", "start": 329.84, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "the trust of Mozambi is", "start": 338.16, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "uh result of a living memory of the", "start": 342.639, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "Mozambi people. It is in this period", "start": 346.08, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "that Mozambique would like to commend", "start": 348.56, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "the leadership of the secretary general", "start": 350.96, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Antonio Gutes whose tenure uh coincided", "start": 353.52, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "with a period marked with enormous", "start": 358.16, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "global challenges and in which the", "start": 360.4, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "limits of multilateralism", "start": 363.68, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "were put to test.", "start": 365.919, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "He leaves behind a robust organization", "start": 368.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "that is prepared to a better respond to", "start": 372.319, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "the challenges of our time. His legacy", "start": 375.12, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "is in our point of view unquestionable,", "start": 378.8, "duration": 8.959}, {"text": "positive and marked by transformative", "start": 382.96, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "achievements of this organization. Thus", "start": 387.759, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "the best tribute we can pay to his", "start": 390.72, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "legacy is to continue the work of", "start": 393.52, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "strengthening this organization because", "start": 397.36, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "no generation is going to inherit uh", "start": 400.56, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "united nation as a finished legacy. Your", "start": 404.72, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "excellencies, today the three pillars", "start": 407.68, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "amongst which the UN work, peace and", "start": 410.8, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "security, development and human rights", "start": 414.88, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "are under unprecedented", "start": 418.479, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "pressure.", "start": 421.599, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "In the realm of peace, security,", "start": 424.0, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "we witness gloriferation of conflicts,", "start": 428.24, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "worsening of civilian suffering and the", "start": 432.0, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "spread", "start": 436.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "of terrorism and the expansion of", "start": 438.16, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "transnational organized crime.", "start": 442.16, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "These challenges amongst others must", "start": 446.08, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "lead us to strengthen compliance with", "start": 449.759, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "the promotion of the mechanism for", "start": 453.84, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "prevention and peaceful resolution of", "start": 455.84, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "conflict as well as what we are going to", "start": 458.56, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "do at the international law in the light", "start": 462.319, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "of United Nation Charter including", "start": 465.039, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "respect for those sovereignity and", "start": 467.919, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "territorial integrity of our states. the", "start": 471.52, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "human rights and international", "start": 474.879, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "cooperation factors that are in fact", "start": 476.879, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "inseparable", "start": 481.52, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "to be", "start": 483.44, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "truthful. In this way, we will be able", "start": 485.599, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "to address conflicts that persist around", "start": 489.12, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "the world, including in some countries", "start": 492.72, "duration": 8.479}, {"text": "and regions of our continent, Africa.", "start": 496.0, "duration": 9.199}, {"text": "It is also this that under analyze the", "start": 501.199, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "support of our defense for solutions for", "start": 505.199, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "two states for Palestine.", "start": 508.4, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "Living side by side with peace and", "start": 511.919, "duration": 8.401}, {"text": "security with Israel has a legitimate", "start": 515.599, "duration": 8.641}, {"text": "and lasting path forward.", "start": 520.32, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "The principle of self-determination of", "start": 524.24, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "the people enshrined in the United", "start": 526.48, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "Nation charter as far back as 19 45", "start": 529.44, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "remain so valid as ever. It is in this", "start": 534.32, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "context that we reaffirm our principled", "start": 537.76, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "position in support the cause for the", "start": 541.6, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "safari people. The value enshrined in", "start": 545.04, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "the United Nation CH charter elevate", "start": 549.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "this organization to be the epicenter", "start": 552.48, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "for global multilateralism.", "start": 554.959, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "For this reason, we oppose to imposition", "start": 557.2, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "of unilateral co co measures which", "start": 561.279, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "continues to penalize entire people in", "start": 565.36, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "clear violation of the affirmation", "start": 568.48, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "charter of the UN. We thus reiterate our", "start": 571.839, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "position in the support of ending of", "start": 575.279, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "economic, commercial and financial", "start": 578.64, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "blockade imposed to against Kuba.", "start": 581.68, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Likewise, we wish to express our", "start": 584.959, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "solidarity with the brotherly people of", "start": 587.44, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Zimbabwe and reiterate our position in", "start": 590.48, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "favor of unconditional lifting of", "start": 594.24, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "sanctions against Zimbabwe and the other", "start": 597.36, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "countries in the world.", "start": 602.0, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "We also advocate for mutual bene", "start": 605.04, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "benefical economic cooperation based on", "start": 607.839, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "respect for sovereignity for each state", "start": 611.44, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "for the equality between the states and", "start": 614.64, "duration": 8.879}, {"text": "the freedom of choice for the people", "start": 619.36, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "during the electoral process. In the", "start": 623.519, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "area of development, we are still far", "start": 626.64, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "from fulfilling the promise of the 2030", "start": 630.079, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "agenda. With less than four years until", "start": 634.88, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "the deadline, millions of people remain", "start": 638.16, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "deprived of basic opportunities,", "start": 641.92, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "water, energy, infrastructure,", "start": 645.279, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "and others.", "start": 648.8, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Thus, it's important to accelerate the", "start": 651.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "implementation of the commitment made", "start": 654.0, "duration": 7.8}, {"text": "under the SDGs", "start": 656.72, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "which requires predictable,", "start": 662.24, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "accessible and sustainable financing. It", "start": 666.32, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "is also requires a fair international", "start": 670.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "financial agreeature,", "start": 674.32, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "more fair sustainable debt relief,", "start": 676.56, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "greater transfer of technology,", "start": 680.88, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "international trade that is more", "start": 684.0, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "balanced and investments that can", "start": 686.959, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "transform the potential into prosperity", "start": 690.079, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "as well as adhere to the principle of", "start": 692.959, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "common responsibility", "start": 695.92, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "but differentiated responsibility.", "start": 698.32, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "ilities. Similarly, in the field of", "start": 700.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "human rights, it's also important to", "start": 702.959, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "promote a balanced and impartial and", "start": 705.2, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "coherent approach based on the", "start": 708.32, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "principles of universality and equal", "start": 711.44, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "treatment between the states. Promoting", "start": 715.519, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "these rights should prioritize", "start": 719.44, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "constructive dialogue, cooperation, and", "start": 721.76, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "the strengthening of our institutions.", "start": 725.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Mr. President in Mosmbique, we are", "start": 727.839, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "committed to consolidating", "start": 730.88, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "peace,", "start": 733.68, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "strengthening democratic institutions", "start": 735.44, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "and conducting an inclusive national", "start": 738.639, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "dialogue led by the Mozambicans", "start": 741.92, "duration": 8.159}, {"text": "uh initiatives that genuinely moan to", "start": 746.16, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "deepen reconciliation, national unity,", "start": 750.079, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "the peace and the reforms that are", "start": 753.6, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "necessary with the support of our", "start": 756.639, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "partners, international partners while", "start": 759.279, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "respecting the national ownership", "start": 762.639, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "in Cabel Gadu. We have made progress in", "start": 766.959, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "fighting terrorism and strengthening", "start": 770.639, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "security", "start": 773.6, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "thanks to the efforts of the defense and", "start": 775.12, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "security and the support of SADC, the", "start": 778.48, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "European Union, Rwanda and Tanzania.", "start": 782.399, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "However, the stabilization remains", "start": 786.56, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "incomplete and requires a concentrated", "start": 789.36, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "response and a greater international", "start": 793.279, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "cooperation for the fight against", "start": 795.92, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "terrorism.", "start": 798.0, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "We are grateful for the solidarity we", "start": 799.68, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "have received and we call for a more", "start": 801.68, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "predictable and coordinated", "start": 803.92, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "international support to consolidate", "start": 806.079, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "security, stabilization,", "start": 808.639, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "reconstruction", "start": 811.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "and development in the affected areas", "start": 812.959, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "where the local force is still doing the", "start": 816.88, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "work in the fight against terrorism.", "start": 820.16, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "within the framework of the national", "start": 822.8, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "development plan 2025", "start": 825.2, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "and 20", "start": 828.32, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "25 to 2044. Mozambi is committed to", "start": 831.839, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "transforming its potential into shared", "start": 836.0, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "prosperity for the people through the", "start": 838.0, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "valorization of resources and investing", "start": 840.639, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "in human capital especially in the youth", "start": 843.839, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "and women which are the majority.", "start": 848.399, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "We also want to increase value to the", "start": 852.639, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "natural resources. We also want to", "start": 855.279, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "modernize our agriculture, promote", "start": 857.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "industrialization, develop tourism,", "start": 860.24, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "expand access to energy, invest", "start": 863.36, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "infrastructures, education, health,", "start": 866.16, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "science and technology, digitalization", "start": 869.839, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "and in the economy in general. Natural", "start": 874.8, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "resources should contribute to the", "start": 878.399, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "economic diversification of our economy.", "start": 881.04, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "The mobilization of income and", "start": 884.8, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "investment in our biggest asset which is", "start": 888.88, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "the talent of the Mozambique people and", "start": 892.32, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "the talent of the African people. Our", "start": 896.079, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "location in the Indian Ocean, our", "start": 899.6, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "logistic corridors and our agricultural", "start": 902.56, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "potential, energy and mineral uh make", "start": 905.519, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "Mozambique a strategic platform for the", "start": 909.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "investment and regional integration.", "start": 912.72, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "We therefore seek uh partnerships that", "start": 916.56, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "build national capacity, promote local", "start": 920.88, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "content, respect the environment", "start": 924.399, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "and generate employment especially for", "start": 927.839, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "the young people and women.", "start": 930.959, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "Mozambique will continue to diversify", "start": 934.8, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "its partnership in sovereign way,", "start": 938.32, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "transparent and mutual beneficial manner", "start": 943.04, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "working with all the parties in the", "start": 947.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "light of the national priorities.", "start": 949.839, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "This is also the Africa's ambition", "start": 952.88, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "to be the architect of their own destiny", "start": 957.12, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "to participate in setting the rules and", "start": 961.36, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "to fully benefit from the wealth it", "start": 965.04, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "helps to create.", "start": 968.56, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "Africa faces however a paradox. It is", "start": 971.199, "duration": 9.76}, {"text": "rich in resources yet retains little of", "start": 975.759, "duration": 9.601}, {"text": "the value that it generates.", "start": 980.959, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "Therefore, investment must involve and", "start": 985.36, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "from simple extraction to the", "start": 989.519, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "transformation, creation of value chain", "start": 992.079, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "at the local level, moving from", "start": 995.04, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "transactions to partnerships, from", "start": 997.92, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "dependence to capacity building and from", "start": 1000.48, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "exportation of resources to the", "start": 1004.399, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "construction of value chains both", "start": 1006.399, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "national, regional and international.", "start": 1009.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "In this context, the regional", "start": 1012.72, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "integration,", "start": 1014.8, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "takes a strategic importance", "start": 1016.56, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "as it amplifies markets, creates", "start": 1020.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "economies, integrates productive", "start": 1024.079, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "challenges, attracts investment and", "start": 1027.12, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "stimulate innovation", "start": 1029.839, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "and also transforming the potent the", "start": 1032.16, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "economic potential into uh concrete", "start": 1035.36, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "opportunity especially for its people", "start": 1038.319, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "and young people in particular in", "start": 1041.6, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "Mozambique. This vision translate into", "start": 1044.0, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "progress on", "start": 1046.959, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "electricity interconnectors", "start": 1049.44, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "with neighboring countries as well as in", "start": 1051.84, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "onetop borders crossing points that we", "start": 1054.64, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "are building. The integration is built", "start": 1058.48, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "through roads that bring people closer", "start": 1061.84, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "with energy that crosses borders,", "start": 1066.4, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "infrastructures that transform", "start": 1068.64, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "neighboring communities into single", "start": 1070.4, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "communities, a transformation that", "start": 1073.12, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "requires fair and sustainable financing", "start": 1075.039, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "conditions.", "start": 1077.52, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "Your excellencies, with less than four", "start": 1079.039, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "years remaining for the achievement of", "start": 1081.6, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "the 23rd agenda, the developing country", "start": 1085.44, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "continue to face high financing costs,", "start": 1088.4, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "rising depth, and limited access to", "start": 1091.44, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "resources to invest in their own", "start": 1094.72, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "development. We continue to advocate for", "start": 1097.6, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "a fair international architecture, more", "start": 1100.72, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "predictable and accessible financing and", "start": 1104.4, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "sustainable to sustainable solutions for", "start": 1107.84, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "the depth. It is also necessary that the", "start": 1111.6, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "access to concessional financing take", "start": 1115.039, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "into account the country's", "start": 1117.679, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "vulnerabilities", "start": 1119.679, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "beyond just the income that uh we also", "start": 1121.679, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "want to make sure that developed", "start": 1126.24, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "countries can fully fulfill their", "start": 1128.08, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "commitment to development and financial", "start": 1130.32, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "action for Mozambique as one of the", "start": 1132.799, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "countries that is more vulnerable in the", "start": 1135.679, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "world. climate change. They translate", "start": 1138.16, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "into losses in life, displaced families,", "start": 1142.16, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "destroyed crops and damaged", "start": 1145.919, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "infrastructures", "start": 1148.72, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "cyclically.", "start": 1150.48, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "The cyclones demonstrate", "start": 1152.16, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "that resilience is now an environmental,", "start": 1156.48, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "economic and food security", "start": 1160.4, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "uh social for development issue and", "start": 1164.16, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "increasingly one of peace and security", "start": 1167.12, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "in all the world. We therefore reiterate", "start": 1170.799, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "the need to increase funding for", "start": 1174.16, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "adaptation, facilitate access to climate", "start": 1176.24, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "funds, operationalize", "start": 1180.64, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "the loss and damage mechanisms and", "start": 1182.88, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "invest in early warning systems and", "start": 1186.24, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "resilient infrastructure.", "start": 1189.52, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "Mozambi remains highly vulnerable to", "start": 1193.039, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "extreme weather events, floods,", "start": 1195.679, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "inundations,", "start": 1199.52, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "cyclones", "start": 1201.12, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "and uh we are concerned", "start": 1202.88, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "with the El Nino that", "start": 1206.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "might have potential severe impact in", "start": 1210.0, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "the central and southern parts of the", "start": 1212.72, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "country especially when it comes to", "start": 1214.48, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "droughts, food insecurity and", "start": 1216.88, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "livelihood. The preparedness and", "start": 1219.919, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "international cooperation will be", "start": 1222.4, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "essential to mitigate these impacts in a", "start": 1224.559, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "context where humanitarian needs are", "start": 1228.32, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "already facing a severe funding", "start": 1230.96, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "shortfall in the whole world. Mr.", "start": 1234.96, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "President digital transformation remains", "start": 1238.4, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "or demands the same solidarity that we", "start": 1241.76, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "are talking about because Africa must", "start": 1244.0, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "not limit itself to supplying the", "start": 1247.039, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "minerals that fuels the world innovation", "start": 1249.679, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "hubs. We need to have investment in", "start": 1252.4, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "connectivity,", "start": 1254.88, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "computing capacity,", "start": 1256.48, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "scientific research, training of young", "start": 1259.12, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "people in Africa, technology transfer,", "start": 1262.4, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "governance, uh, ethics for AI in the", "start": 1266.32, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "spirit of partnership that build", "start": 1270.72, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "capacity and promotes autonomy", "start": 1272.96, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "of our sovereignity states. Thus,", "start": 1276.88, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "Mozambi reiterates its support for the", "start": 1280.0, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "objectives of the UN8", "start": 1284.4, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "initiative to make this organization", "start": 1287.6, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "more effective, coherent,", "start": 1290.96, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "inclusive,", "start": 1294.4, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "representative, and suited to the", "start": 1295.919, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "challenges of our time. Reform must be", "start": 1299.28, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "embraced as political commitment focused", "start": 1303.12, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "on concrete results.", "start": 1306.4, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Reforms must also correct imbalances in", "start": 1311.919, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "representation of global governance. In", "start": 1315.84, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "this regard, Africa cannot continue to", "start": 1319.12, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "be in a center of the security council", "start": 1321.919, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "agenda while remaining absent from its", "start": 1326.08, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "rank of permanent members. Africa must", "start": 1330.08, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "be a permanent member of the security", "start": 1334.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "council of the UN. We therefore reaffirm", "start": 1337.28, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "the common African position", "start": 1340.72, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "uh related to the reform of the United", "start": 1343.84, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Nation Security Council based on the", "start": 1347.039, "duration": 7.441}, {"text": "Euluini consensus and the search", "start": 1351.2, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "declaration under which no fewer than", "start": 1354.48, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "two permanent seats with all", "start": 1358.0, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "prerogatives and privileges including", "start": 1360.24, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "the veto as long as it exists and five", "start": 1363.12, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "non-permanent seats are allocated to", "start": 1366.48, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "Africa. The contribution that Mosabi", "start": 1371.12, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "wishes to make to the debate on this", "start": 1374.08, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "assembly has the objective of restoring", "start": 1377.039, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "trust through peace, manage", "start": 1380.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "transformation through inclusion and", "start": 1382.4, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "produce result through a coherent uh", "start": 1385.36, "duration": 5.876}, {"text": "actions at the national, regional", "start": 1388.72, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "[snorts]", "start": 1391.236, "duration": 4.844}, {"text": "and global levels. To this it's", "start": 1392.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "important to strengthen international", "start": 1396.08, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "cooperation and equip the UN with", "start": 1397.76, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "greater capacity to address the", "start": 1400.64, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "challenges of the present and make sure", "start": 1403.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "that the future generations can have a", "start": 1407.2, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "stronger organization that one we have", "start": 1409.44, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "received. An organization equal to the", "start": 1411.44, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "challenges of our time capable of", "start": 1414.24, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "serving the people with dignity,", "start": 1416.64, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "protecting the planet and promoting a", "start": 1418.96, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "share prosperity at international level.", "start": 1421.52, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "Your excellencies the 81 81 years ago", "start": 1425.28, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "the founders of this organization", "start": 1429.76, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "entrusted humanity with a promise of", "start": 1431.52, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "peace, cooperation and dignity and most", "start": 1434.48, "duration": 9.28}, {"text": "of all hope. Today that responsibility", "start": 1438.799, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "uh falls to us and the path remains very", "start": 1443.76, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "clear. Dialogue,", "start": 1447.679, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "cooperation,", "start": 1450.08, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "partnership,", "start": 1451.919, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "innovation,", "start": 1453.679, "duration": 3.201}, {"text": "solidarity", "start": 1455.279, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "and continued strengthening to the role", "start": 1456.88, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "of the United Nations and never the use", "start": 1460.159, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "of force in order to impose decisions.", "start": 1463.679, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "This organization is the most", "start": 1466.88, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "comprehensive expression of our", "start": 1470.08, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "collective responsibility and our", "start": 1472.159, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "commitment to multi multilateralism to", "start": 1474.4, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "the service of the humanity. Mr.", "start": 1477.36, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "President, allow me to conclude by", "start": 1480.0, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "returning to the opening words of our", "start": 1483.2, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "Magna Carta or charter. We the people.", "start": 1486.159, "duration": 9.76}, {"text": "Those words do not belong to the past", "start": 1491.12, "duration": 9.28}, {"text": "but their commitment to a future which", "start": 1495.919, "duration": 8.721}, {"text": "the United Nations remain the expression", "start": 1500.4, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "of our shared responsibility towards", "start": 1504.64, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "uh unity in the humanity.", "start": 1508.64, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Thank you so much for your kind", "start": 1512.72, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "attention.", "start": 1515.12, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly,", "start": 1523.6, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "I wish to thank the president of the", "start": 1526.159, "duration": 6.201}, {"text": "Republic of Mosmbique.", "start": 1528.48, "duration": 3.88}]